                        "review": "This game really did not scratch the itch I thought it would. I love turn based strategies, really love them and yet no matter how many times i start playing this game I always end up giving up on it as it feels boring as fuck!. I ended up feeling ripped off by this one as it is not worth paying full price due to its very shallow gameplay and story.\n\nI can deal with repetitive gameplay as long as the gameplay is good and yet this game misses the mark. It is just so dull and the combat does not feel  good or fun. It is too easy, gets boring very quickly and offers very little satisfaction and sense of progression. You level up characters, but it doesn't really make any difference to the story or the gameplay other than making combat even easier than it already is.\n\nThe game left me feeling like you are jumping from one set of repetitive chores to the next with very little sense of progression and your created character is just one of many characters that do not have any real impact as you go along.",
